// SVG Plot Export — basic SVG generation test
//
// Generates SVG markup for an exponential decay line plot and prints
// it to stdout. Validates that the output contains required SVG tags.
//
// T1: SVG output contains <svg tag
// T2: SVG output contains <polyline tag
// T3: SVG output is non-empty (at least one line printed)
